{
    "word": "constitutionally",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "7f755f79-cb71-3620-ab6d-0bdeda8d138c",
                "word": "constitutionally",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "f1920fe5-e40a-49fd-af7c-d1b3619f2c26",
                        "entry_id": "7f755f79-cb71-3620-ab6d-0bdeda8d138c",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "more constitutionally"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "25ab1b27-781d-4534-8c3c-da8066627643",
                        "entry_id": "7f755f79-cb71-3620-ab6d-0bdeda8d138c",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most constitutionally"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "45bc6aae-9476-3671-8867-b7f0f64614cb",
                        "entry_id": "7f755f79-cb71-3620-ab6d-0bdeda8d138c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Pertaining to one's bodily constitution; physically, physiologically."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "dc7b6191-9527-4e9d-b5b7-cc2881299c76",
                                "sense_id": "45bc6aae-9476-3671-8867-b7f0f64614cb",
                                "text": "These children are constitutionally sad. Other children, like Luke, develop depressive feelings out of the blue or in response to some mild stressor."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "03e7c3b4-f6e3-47fe-b7f6-98ee2ea1a4bf",
                                "sense_id": "45bc6aae-9476-3671-8867-b7f0f64614cb",
                                "text": "The astonishing progress of science had made God quite irrelevant; it had caused human beings to focus so intently on the physical world that they would soon be constitutionally unable to take God seriously."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "87752c36-5ef2-3164-a32f-d4ceabbced7f",
                        "entry_id": "7f755f79-cb71-3620-ab6d-0bdeda8d138c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Pertaining to one's fundamental values or mental inclinations."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7b64072a-957b-4942-bbe1-505c5aaca3dc",
                                "sense_id": "87752c36-5ef2-3164-a32f-d4ceabbced7f",
                                "text": "The effect of this filtering of ideas through the convictions of a class which is constitutionally disposed to certain views is by no means confined to the masses."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "98a52172-d3e2-3293-b0f8-0733ed11c3ec",
                        "entry_id": "7f755f79-cb71-3620-ab6d-0bdeda8d138c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In accordance with a political constitution."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1453669f-2975-47ba-8643-7d9a09f77cf7",
                                "sense_id": "98a52172-d3e2-3293-b0f8-0733ed11c3ec",
                                "text": "“In our view, on the basis of the public record, former President Donald J. Trump is constitutionally disqualified from again being President (or holding any other covered office) because of his role in the attempted overthrow of the 2020 election and the events leading to the January 6 attack,” law professors William Baude and Michael Stokes Paulsen wrote for the University of Pennsylvania Law Review."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5b8dd76d-cbc8-472a-897b-80467a1cbe6c",
                        "source_entry_id": "7f755f79-cb71-3620-ab6d-0bdeda8d138c",
                        "source_sense_description": "in accordance with a political constitution",
                        "target_lang_word": "constitutionnellement",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "constitutionnellement",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2aedf6a0-b07d-3800-abdf-264b363ede76",
                                        "entry_id": "84075a47-5c13-3e95-b7c9-d1f55069bc34",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "D’une manière constitutionnelle ; en conformité avec la constitution."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "55a552d2-bb52-4eab-aa5f-863c53e5cf90",
                                                "sense_id": "2aedf6a0-b07d-3800-abdf-264b363ede76",
                                                "text": "Commencée le 14 octobre 1877, la deuxième législature prend constitutionnellement fin le 13 octobre 1881. On n'envisage donc pas les élections générales avant l’automne."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "34bcc56f-b9ba-4970-98db-6199425367d5",
                                                "sense_id": "2aedf6a0-b07d-3800-abdf-264b363ede76",
                                                "text": "Autre difficulté : contrairement aux départements et aux régions, les métropoles ne sont pas des collectivités locales de plein exercice, et leur existence semble constitutionnellement fragile."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bdf60d00-d99b-38f6-b8b0-bc6f49584bcd",
                                        "entry_id": "84075a47-5c13-3e95-b7c9-d1f55069bc34",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "D’une manière conforme à la constitution d’une personne."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e8928bd3-a663-499f-b3b0-750d6744aae2",
                                                "sense_id": "bdf60d00-d99b-38f6-b8b0-bc6f49584bcd",
                                                "text": "C’était un de ces hommes qui sont constitutionnellement incapables de rien faire sans donner le maximum de leur force et de l’énergie qui est en eux, en un spasme rageur toujours renouvelé."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b12a2953-a984-4457-8c1e-0507c11482fb",
                                                "sense_id": "bdf60d00-d99b-38f6-b8b0-bc6f49584bcd",
                                                "text": "L’amour excessif qui les entraîne, constitutionnellement, disent les médecins, vers la femme, emploie toutes les forces morales et physiques de ces hommes énergiques."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
